{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>馬鞍山利安邨有人倒斃家中。今日（18日）下午2時13分，利興樓一名55歲姓甘男住戶被發現在單位內暈倒，其家人報警求助。</p><p>救援人員接報趕抵現場，消防破門入屋後，發現甘男倒臥單位內，救護員經檢驗後證實他已明顯死亡。警方經初步調查後，將案件列作「屍體發現」，甘男死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><figure><img alt=\"馬鞍山利安邨利興樓有住戶倒斃家中。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251012/1054039559689474048147302.jpeg/uouyv-abu-kTxJe16BQX57rn-FxEkclmcG79CVpu_Qk\"/><figcaption>馬鞍山利安邨利興樓有住戶倒斃家中。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:06.332249+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:13:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:37:34.032485+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:27.019884+00:00","content_hash":"8ea274163f7e9265a813dbd4f6bba0c34078f3f0c184d39f273c2266fa1ddb85","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}